        <briefdescription>
<para>Equivalent to <ref refid="group__mux__interface_1ga1fcf4fd9a94643c1b778994f76b64150" kindref="member">MUX_CONTROL_DT_SPEC_DEFINE_BY_IDX(node_id, 0)</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Example devicetree fragment: <verbatim>n: node {
