};
</verbatim></para>
<para>Example usage: <verbatim>MUX_CONTROL_DT_SPEC_DEFINE(DT_NODELABEL(n));
const struct mux_control *m = MUX_CONTROL_DT_GET(DT_NODELABEL(n));
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
